
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>J1 Studio - استضافة البوتات</title>

    <!-- =========================
         Google Font
    ========================= -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet"
    >

    <!-- =========================
         Font Awesome
    ========================= -->
    <link
        rel="stylesheet"
        href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.2/css/all.min.css"
    >

    <style>

        /* =====================================================
           ROOT
        ===================================================== */

        :root {

            /* Background */
            --bg: #080808;
            --bg-soft: #101010;
            --bg-light: #171717;

            /* Cards */
            --card: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.055);
            --card-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.085);

            /* White / Gray */
            --white: #ffffff;
            --text: #f5f5f5;
            --text-soft: #c8c8c8;
            --muted: #8b8b8b;

            /* Borders */
            --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11);
            --border-light: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);

            /* Main */
            --primary: #ffffff;
            --primary-dark: #dcdcdc;

            /* Shadows */
            --shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
            --glow: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }


        /* =====================================================
           RESET
        ===================================================== */

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;

            font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;

            transition:
                background 0.3s ease,
                border-color 0.3s ease,
                color 0.3s ease,
                transform 0.3s ease,
                box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }


        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }


        body {

            min-height: 100vh;

            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    circle at 15% 10%,
                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07),
                    transparent 28%
                ),

                radial-gradient(
                    circle at 85% 80%,
                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045),
                    transparent 30%
                ),

                linear-gradient(
                    145deg,
                    #050505 0%,
                    #0b0b0b 45%,
                    #111111 100%
                );

            color: var(--text);

            overflow-x: hidden;
        }


        body::before {

            content: "";

            position: fixed;

            inset: 0;

            pointer-events: none;

            background-image:
                linear-gradient(
                    rgba(255,255,255,0.018) 1px,
                    transparent 1px
                ),
                linear-gradient(
                    90deg,
                    rgba(255,255,255,0.018) 1px,
                    transparent 1px
                );

            background-size: 60px 60px;

            mask-image: linear-gradient(
                to bottom,
                black,
                transparent 85%
            );

            z-index: -1;
        }


        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }


        /* =====================================================
           HEADER
        ===================================================== */

        header {

            position: sticky;

            top: 0;

            z-index: 1000;

            width: 100%;

            display: flex;

            justify-content: space-between;

            align-items: center;

            padding: 18px 8%;

            background: rgba(8, 8, 8, 0.82);

            backdrop-filter: blur(18px);

            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);

            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }


        .logo {

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            gap: 11px;

            font-size: 23px;

            font-weight: 900;

            color: var(--white);
        }


        .logo i {

            width: 40px;

            height: 40px;

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            justify-content: center;

            border-radius: 10px;

            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);

            border: 1px solid var(--border);

            color: var(--white);

            font-size: 18px;
        }


        .logo:hover i {

            background: var(--white);

            color: #080808;

            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }


        .nav-user {

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            gap: 12px;
        }


        /* =====================================================
           BUTTONS
        ===================================================== */

        .btn {

            min-height: 44px;

            padding: 10px 21px;

            border-radius: 10px;

            display: inline-flex;

            align-items: center;

            justify-content: center;

            gap: 9px;

            font-size: 14px;

            font-weight: 700;

            cursor: pointer;

            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }


        .btn-primary {

            color: #080808;

            background: var(--white);

            border-color: var(--white);

            box-shadow:
                0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }


        .btn-primary:hover {

            background: #dcdcdc;

            border-color: #dcdcdc;

            transform: translateY(-2px);

            box-shadow:
                0 10px 30px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }


        .btn-outline {

            color: var(--text);

            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);

            border-color: var(--border-light);
        }


        .btn-outline:hover {

            color: #080808;

            background: var(--white);

            border-color: var(--white);

            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }


        /* =====================================================
           HERO
        ===================================================== */

        .hero {

            position: relative;

            max-width: 950px;

            margin: auto;

            padding: 125px 20px 110px;

            text-align: center;
        }


        .hero::before {

            content: "";

            position: absolute;

            width: 380px;

            height: 380px;

            top: 40px;

            left: 50%;

            transform: translateX(-50%);

            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);

            filter: blur(80px);

            border-radius: 50%;

            z-index: -1;
        }


        .hero h1 {

            max-width: 850px;

            margin: 0 auto 24px;

            font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 58px);

            line-height: 1.3;

            font-weight: 900;

            letter-spacing: -1px;

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    #ffffff 20%,
                    #aaaaaa 70%,
                    #ffffff 100%
                );

            -webkit-background-clip: text;

            background-clip: text;

            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }


        .hero p {

            max-width: 720px;

            margin: 0 auto 38px;

            color: var(--muted);

            font-size: 17px;

            line-height: 2;
        }


        .hero-btns {

            display: flex;

            justify-content: center;

            align-items: center;

            gap: 12px;
        }


        .hero-btns .btn {

            min-width: 200px;
        }


        /* =====================================================
           SECTION
        ===================================================== */

        section {

            position: relative;
        }


        .section-title {

            text-align: center;

            margin-bottom: 48px;

            font-size: 31px;

            font-weight: 800;

            color: var(--white);
        }


        .section-title::after {

            content: "";

            display: block;

            width: 48px;

            height: 3px;

            margin: 13px auto 0;

            border-radius: 10px;

            background: var(--white);

            box-shadow:
                0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        }


        /* =====================================================
           FEATURES
        ===================================================== */

        .features-section {

            padding: 20px 8% 100px;
        }


        .grid-container {

            max-width: 1200px;

            margin: auto;

            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns:
                repeat(
                    auto-fit,
                    minmax(280px, 1fr)
                );

            gap: 22px;
        }


        .card {

            position: relative;

            padding: 32px;

            min-height: 230px;

            overflow: hidden;

            border-radius: 17px;

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    145deg,
                    rgba(255,255,255,0.075),
                    rgba(255,255,255,0.025)
                );

            border: 1px solid var(--border);

            box-shadow:
                0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);

            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);

            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        }


        .card::before {

            content: "";

            position: absolute;

            top: 0;

            right: 0;

            left: 0;

            height: 1px;

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    90deg,
                    transparent,
                    rgba(255,255,255,0.45),
                    transparent
                );

            opacity: 0;

            transition: 0.3s ease;
        }


        .card::after {

            content: "";

            position: absolute;

            width: 130px;

            height: 130px;

            top: -70px;

            left: -70px;

            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.035);

            border-radius: 50%;

            filter: blur(20px);
        }


        .card:hover {

            transform: translateY(-6px);

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    145deg,
                    rgba(255,255,255,0.105),
                    rgba(255,255,255,0.035)
                );

            border-color: var(--border-light);

            box-shadow:
                0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.35),
                0 0 30px rgba(255,255,255,0.035);
        }


        .card:hover::before {

            opacity: 1;
        }


        .card-icon {

            width: 55px;

            height: 55px;

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            justify-content: center;

            margin-bottom: 23px;

            border-radius: 14px;

            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);

            border: 1px solid var(--border);

            color: var(--white);

            font-size: 23px;
        }


        .card:hover .card-icon {

            background: var(--white);

            color: #080808;

            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }


        .card h3 {

            margin-bottom: 12px;

            font-size: 19px;

            font-weight: 800;

            color: var(--white);
        }


        .card p {

            color: var(--muted);

            font-size: 14px;

            line-height: 1.9;
        }


        /* =====================================================
           PRICING
        ===================================================== */

        .pricing-section {

            padding: 90px 8%;

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    180deg,
                    rgba(255,255,255,0.025),
                    rgba(255,255,255,0.045)
                );

            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);

            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }


        .pricing-grid {

            max-width: 1100px;

            margin: auto;

            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns:
                repeat(
                    auto-fit,
                    minmax(280px, 1fr)
                );

            gap: 22px;
        }


        .price-card {

            position: relative;

            padding: 35px 30px;

            text-align: center;

            border-radius: 18px;

            background:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.045);

            border: 1px solid var(--border);

            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        }


        .price-card:hover {

            transform: translateY(-5px);

            border-color: var(--border-light);

            box-shadow:
                0 20px 45px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }


        .price-card.premium {

            border-color:
                rgba(255,255,255,0.35);

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    145deg,
                    rgba(255,255,255,0.09),
                    rgba(255,255,255,0.035)
                );

            box-shadow:
                0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
        }


        .price-title {

            margin-bottom: 10px;

            font-size: 21px;

            font-weight: 800;

            color: var(--white);
        }


        .price-amount {

            margin-bottom: 25px;

            font-size: 36px;

            font-weight: 900;

            color: var(--white);
        }


        .price-amount span {

            font-size: 14px;

            color: var(--muted);

            font-weight: 500;
        }


        .features-list {

            list-style: none;

            text-align: right;

            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }


        .features-list li {

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            gap: 10px;

            padding: 9px 0;

            color: var(--text-soft);

            font-size: 14px;

            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        }


        .features-list li:last-child {

            border-bottom: none;
        }


        .features-list li i {

            color: var(--white);

            font-size: 12px;
        }


        .price-btn {

            width: 100%;
        }


        /* =====================================================
           FOOTER
        ===================================================== */

        footer {

            padding: 40px 20px;

            text-align: center;

            background: #060606;

            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);

            color: var(--muted);

            font-size: 13px;
        }


        footer strong {

            color: var(--text-soft);

            font-weight: 700;
        }


        /* =====================================================
           RESPONSIVE
        ===================================================== */

        @media (max-width: 768px) {

            header {

                padding: 15px 5%;

                gap: 15px;
            }


            .logo {

                font-size: 19px;
            }


            .logo i {

                width: 36px;

                height: 36px;
            }


            .nav-user {

                gap: 7px;
            }


            .nav-user .btn {

                padding: 8px 13px;

                min-height: 40px;

                font-size: 12px;
            }


            .hero {

                padding: 90px 20px 80px;
            }


            .hero h1 {

                font-size: 34px;
            }


            .hero p {

                font-size: 15px;

                line-height: 1.9;
            }


            .hero-btns {

                flex-direction: column;

                width: 100%;
            }


            .hero-btns .btn {

                width: 100%;

                max-width: 320px;
            }


            .features-section {

                padding:
                    10px 5% 70px;
            }


            .pricing-section {

                padding:
                    70px 5%;
            }


            .section-title {

                font-size: 27px;

                margin-bottom: 35px;
            }
        }


        @media (max-width: 480px) {

            header {

                flex-direction: column;

                align-items: stretch;
            }


            .logo {

                justify-content: center;
            }


            .nav-user {

                width: 100%;

                justify-content: center;
            }


            .nav-user .btn {

                flex: 1;

                white-space: nowrap;
            }


            .hero {

                padding-top: 65px;
            }


            .hero h1 {

                font-size: 29px;
            }


            .hero p {

                font-size: 14px;
            }


            .card {

                padding: 27px;

                min-height: auto;
            }


            .card-icon {

                width: 50px;

                height: 50px;
            }
        }

    </style>
</head>


<body>


    <!-- =====================================================
         HEADER
    ===================================================== -->

    <header>

        <a href="/" class="logo">

            <i class="fa-solid fa-server"></i>

            <span>J1 Studio</span>

        </a>


        <div class="nav-user">

            <a href="/login" class="btn btn-outline">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-right-to-bracket"></i>

                تسجيل الدخول

            </a>


            <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-primary">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-gauge-high"></i>

                لوحة التحكم

            </a>

        </div>

    </header>



    <!-- =====================================================
         HERO
    ===================================================== -->

    <section class="hero">

        <h1>
            استضافة احترافية لبوتاتك ومشاريعك
        </h1>


        <p>
            استضف بوتاتك وتطبيقاتك بسهولة مع منصة سريعة
            ومستقرة، توفر لك لوحة تحكم متطورة لإدارة
            الملفات والسيرفرات والكونسول من مكان واحد.
        </p>


        <div class="hero-btns">

            <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-rocket"></i>

                ابدأ الآن

            </a>

        </div>

    </section>



    <!-- =====================================================
         FEATURES
    ===================================================== -->

    <section class="features-section">

        <h2 class="section-title">
            مميزات المنصة
        </h2>


        <div class="grid-container">


            <!-- Feature 1 -->

            <div class="card">

                <div class="card-icon">

                    <i class="fa-solid fa-terminal"></i>

                </div>


                <h3>
                    كونسول مباشر
                </h3>


                <p>
                    تابع سجلات وتشغيل بوتك بشكل مباشر
                    وتحكم كامل في العمليات من لوحة التحكم.
                </p>

            </div>



            <!-- Feature 2 -->

            <div class="card">

                <div class="card-icon">

                    <i class="fa-solid fa-folder-open"></i>

                </div>


                <h3>
                    مدير ملفات متطور
                </h3>


                <p>
                    ارفع ملفات مشروعك، عدلها، احذفها
                    وفك ضغط الملفات بسهولة مباشرة من المتصفح.
                </p>

            </div>



            <!-- Feature 3 -->

            <div class="card">

                <div class="card-icon">

                    <i class="fa-solid fa-server"></i>

                </div>


                <h3>
                    تشغيل مستقر
                </h3>


                <p>
                    بيئة تشغيل مستقرة لمشاريعك مع إمكانية
                    إعادة التشغيل والتحكم بالسيرفر بسهولة.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>



    <!-- =====================================================
         FOOTER
    ===================================================== -->

    <footer>

        <p>
            © 2026 <strong>J1 Studio</strong>.
            جميع الحقوق محفوظة.
        </p>

    </footer>


</body>
</html>
